  "html": "<div id=\"question-11749\" class=\"question\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                        <div class=\"questionNumber\">Question 3</div>\n\n                        \n                               \n                         \n        \n\n                        \n                            <div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img id=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-11749\"></div>\n                        \n\n                        <div id=\"questionText-11749\" class=\"questionText\">\n                            <p>The vectors <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"10\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> are shown in the diagram above. Which of the following could be <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"11\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p></p>\n                                     \n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                            <table class=\"choicesTable\">\n                                <tbody><tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceALetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-11749-choiceA\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"a\">a</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td class=\"choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-11749-a-2\"> </td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-11749-choiceB\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"b\">b</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBText\" class=\"choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-11749-a-3\"> </td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-11749-choiceC\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"c\">c</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCText\" class=\"choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-11749-a-5\"></td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-11749-choiceD\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"d\">d</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDText\" class=\"choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-11749-a-1\"></td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceELetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                        \n                                        <div id=\"question-11749-choiceE\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"e\">e</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceEText\" class=\"choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-11749-a-4\"></td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody></table> \n                              \n                    </div>",
